{"id":"en_the-emperor-s-envoy","title":"The Emperor's Envoy","titleEn":"The Emperor's Envoy","description":"After an unexpected journey back in time, Zhang Ye assumes his modern knowledge will allow him to prosper in the past. He soon discovers, however, that life without official standing is grim. The imperial exam becomes his sole route forward, and he secures a place as a scholar-in-training, yet he lacks the funds to make the journey. In a desperate effort to finance his trip, his father sells both Zhang Ye and his sister into servitude. Setting out for the capital, Zhang Ye learns of the sacrifices his family has made on his behalf and resolves to improve their lives. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-emperors-envoy/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-emperors-envoy/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Hidden Identity","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm77u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-emperor-s-envoy_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm77u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-emperor-s-envoy_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm77u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-emperor-s-envoy_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm77u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-emperor-s-envoy_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":